{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/4f93f065c18439ae7f3a2bd718cecb7b.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/4f93f065c18439ae7f3a2bd718cecb7b.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/4f93f065c18439ae7f3a2bd718cecb7b.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just a cleaner. You\u2019re an undercover agent, infiltrating the world of crime by posing as a cleaner, slowly collecting evidence against a mysterious hitman. The hitman runs a large organization called the syndicate who have bunch of cleaners, targets and hitmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to catch the leader of the Syndicate by posting as one of the cleaners. The deeper you dig, the closer you get to uncovering how he operates\u2014and how he does his assassinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/64f7d5278b5d9eff008afe8ab4ce189d.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/64f7d5278b5d9eff008afe8ab4ce189d.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/64f7d5278b5d9eff008afe8ab4ce189d.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a psychological horror game. As you explore a crime scene, unsettling things could happen\u2014shadows, whispers, apparitions. Watch out for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/072a717d7083257ef6deeaef000a4d4a.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/072a717d7083257ef6deeaef000a4d4a.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/072a717d7083257ef6deeaef000a4d4a.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the part that gets sticky: <strong>You\u2019re deep undercover.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Infiltrate the\u00a0<strong>Syndicate</strong>, a brutal underground organization led by the infamous hitman <strong>Victor Kane</strong>\u2014a man responsible for Hundreds of kills, most of which were never supposed to be possible. The Syndicate doesn\u2019t tolerate failure. And they definitely don\u2019t tolerate rats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/54cdce62b87764a2190a953a2d8fffea.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/54cdce62b87764a2190a953a2d8fffea.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/54cdce62b87764a2190a953a2d8fffea.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dead body has a background story of their own and you can explore more around to gather evidence and know more about the dead. This will give you more information as to why hitman unalived this person. The more you explore, the more rewarding it will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/b62f11b8e6d8a3ee6b46185dc6f9b4dc.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/b62f11b8e6d8a3ee6b46185dc6f9b4dc.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/b62f11b8e6d8a3ee6b46185dc6f9b4dc.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think this is just about cleaning? Think again.<br>You're unraveling a web of assassinations, missing agents, weird rituals, and a secret war that\u2019s been going on for decades. And somehow\u2026 all of it leads back to <strong>Victor Kane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you step into the crime scenes\u2026 the real horror begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/3b2c2eee42c5c603a84aac0f982b6a87.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/3b2c2eee42c5c603a84aac0f982b6a87.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/3b2c2eee42c5c603a84aac0f982b6a87.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861230?t=1767978737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861230?t=1767978737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/9115a49129b2e9088c10920625703922f8bd1934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767978737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/9115a49129b2e9088c10920625703922f8bd1934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767978737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Wiped Clean contains depictions of violent crime scenes with unsettling imagery, including blood and murder evidence. The storyline involves criminal activity, and an exploration of corruption. Sensitive topics such as betrayal, violence are part of the narrative.\r\n\r\nThere are NO depictions of sexual assault/non-consensual sex, BDSM, drug/alcohol abuse.. Viewer discretion is advised."},"demos":[{"appid":4234900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/4f93f065c18439ae7f3a2bd718cecb7b.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/4f93f065c18439ae7f3a2bd718cecb7b.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/4f93f065c18439ae7f3a2bd718cecb7b.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just a cleaner. You\u2019re an undercover agent, infiltrating the world of crime by posing as a cleaner, slowly collecting evidence against a mysterious hitman. The hitman runs a large organization called the syndicate who have bunch of cleaners, targets and hitmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to catch the leader of the Syndicate by posting as one of the cleaners. The deeper you dig, the closer you get to uncovering how he operates\u2014and how he does his assassinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/64f7d5278b5d9eff008afe8ab4ce189d.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/64f7d5278b5d9eff008afe8ab4ce189d.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/64f7d5278b5d9eff008afe8ab4ce189d.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a psychological horror game. As you explore a crime scene, unsettling things could happen\u2014shadows, whispers, apparitions. Watch out for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/072a717d7083257ef6deeaef000a4d4a.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/072a717d7083257ef6deeaef000a4d4a.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/072a717d7083257ef6deeaef000a4d4a.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the part that gets sticky: <strong>You\u2019re deep undercover.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Infiltrate the\u00a0<strong>Syndicate</strong>, a brutal underground organization led by the infamous hitman <strong>Victor Kane</strong>\u2014a man responsible for Hundreds of kills, most of which were never supposed to be possible. The Syndicate doesn\u2019t tolerate failure. And they definitely don\u2019t tolerate rats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/54cdce62b87764a2190a953a2d8fffea.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/54cdce62b87764a2190a953a2d8fffea.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/54cdce62b87764a2190a953a2d8fffea.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dead body has a background story of their own and you can explore more around to gather evidence and know more about the dead. This will give you more information as to why hitman unalived this person. The more you explore, the more rewarding it will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/b62f11b8e6d8a3ee6b46185dc6f9b4dc.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/b62f11b8e6d8a3ee6b46185dc6f9b4dc.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/b62f11b8e6d8a3ee6b46185dc6f9b4dc.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think this is just about cleaning? Think again.<br>You're unraveling a web of assassinations, missing agents, weird rituals, and a secret war that\u2019s been going on for decades. And somehow\u2026 all of it leads back to <strong>Victor Kane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you step into the crime scenes\u2026 the real horror begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/3b2c2eee42c5c603a84aac0f982b6a87.poster.avif?t=1767978737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/3b2c2eee42c5c603a84aac0f982b6a87.webm?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/extras/3b2c2eee42c5c603a84aac0f982b6a87.mp4?t=1767978737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Luminary Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861230/1b1597d1b1ac5e5a32cadc20314624f9f274bc84/header.jpg?t=1767978737","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861230/1274824729/81313f4e982208bd36f550da2897d7afc9a3aa20/1756274895/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756623412","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861230/1274824729/81313f4e982208bd36f550da2897d7afc9a3aa20/1756274895/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756623412","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861230/1274824729/81313f4e982208bd36f550da2897d7afc9a3aa20/1756274895/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756623412","id":257189573,"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189573/f55cea1d914ffb297261905ee81c656d96445